{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-352",
  "title": "Constitution",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Constitution"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Core Principles"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I. Component-First Architecture"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Every feature starts as a reusable Vue component; Components must be self-contained, independently testable, and documented with fixtures; Clear purpose required - no organizational-only components; Components live in `app/components/blocks/` with standardized structure (Component.vue, form.yaml, fixture.ts, theme.ts)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "II. Design System Integration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Every component integrates with the token-driven design system; Design tokens managed via Style Dictionary → CSS variables; Live token editing with localStorage persistence; Components use tailwind-variants for theme composition; Color selection with visual swatches and accessibility considerations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "III. Form-Driven Configuration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Every component exposes configuration via YAML form schemas; Form fields support conditional visibility via `when` conditions; Repeater fields with drag-and-drop reordering; Flat-to-nested prop mapping for complex data structures; Local persistence of form state and repeater order"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "IV. Live Preview & Testing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Every component supports live preview with device frame simulation; Preview modes: Laptop/Tablet/Phone responsive testing; Real-time prop updates with immediate visual feedback; Design token changes applied instantly to preview; Skeleton loaders during component loading states"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "V. Developer Experience"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Every component includes comprehensive documentation and examples; Block registry auto-discovers components from file system; Storybook-like viewer at `/blocks` for component exploration; Hot reloading for rapid development iteration; TypeScript throughout for type safety"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Technology Stack Requirements"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Frontend Framework"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Primary**: Nuxt 3 with Vue 3 Composition API"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**UI Library**: Nuxt UI with Tailwind CSS"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**State Management**: Vue reactive refs with localStorage persistence"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Build Tools**: Vite with TypeScript support"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Design System"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Token Management**: Style Dictionary for design token processing"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Styling**: Tailwind CSS with custom CSS variables"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Theme System**: tailwind-variants for component theming"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Icons**: Iconify with Lucide and Simple Icons"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Development Tools"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Linting**: ESLint with Nuxt ESLint config"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Type Checking**: TypeScript with strict mode"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Package Manager**: pnpm for dependency management"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Version Control**: Git with conventional commit messages"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Development Workflow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Component Creation Process"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Create component directory in `app/components/blocks/[ComponentName]/`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Implement `[ComponentName].vue` with TypeScript"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Define `form.yaml` schema for configuration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Create `fixture.ts` with sample data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Implement `theme.ts` with tailwind-variants"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Test in block viewer at `/blocks/[component-slug]`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Quality Gates"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "All components must pass TypeScript compilation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ESLint must pass without errors"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Components must render correctly in all device preview modes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Form schemas must validate without errors"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Design tokens must apply correctly to components"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Review Process"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "All PRs must include component documentation updates"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "New components must be tested in block viewer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-50",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Design token changes must be validated across all components"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Performance impact must be assessed for new features"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Governance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Constitution supersedes all other practices; Amendments require documentation, approval, and migration plan for existing components; All PRs/reviews must verify compliance with component standards; Complexity must be justified with clear use cases; Use component documentation for runtime development guidance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Version**: 1.0.0 | **Ratified**: 2025-01-27 | **Last Amended**: 2025-01-27"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}